{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1jw2LaMHmCN6witmGPS", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I signed off with a PASS verdict at confidence 0.5. The sweep found no confirmed bugs, but two items are still open.\n\n**What I checked**\n- **Category views:** Images and Documents list the right files, and the FAB is hidden there. It comes back when I return to the storage root.\n- **Multi-file overflow entry:** the label flips correctly between \"Select All\" and \"Deselect All\" as the selection changes. \"Deselect All\" clears the selection.\n- **Properties (background folder sizes):** Alpha shows 1 item, 13 B; Beta shows 1 item, 12 B; Amaze shows 6 items, 41.05 kB. These match the file sizes. The photo.jpg dialog shows the correct size, and its Location and Date are right. The \"Hide from media browsers\" checkbox persists, and I reverted it.\n- **Drawer:** a bookmark I added (Alpha) appears in the drawer, navigates correctly, and can be deleted. The storage row's free space matches the Properties pie chart.\n\n**Open items**\n- **Rotation in a category view:** rotating while Documents is open drops the view to `/storage/emulated/0`. I reproduced it twice and filed it, but the developer could not reproduce it. Rotating inside a normal folder keeps the path but leaves a stale selection bar showing \"0\". I filed that too, and the developer also could not reproduce it.\n- **Bookmark rename wording:** an empty bookmark name shows \"Path cannot be empty\". That wording looks wrong for a name field. I did not file it because I am not sure it is a defect in this build.\n\n**Not covered:** search, compress, encrypt, and a second storage volume (none present on this device).\n\n**Device state:** the device is back in portrait at the storage root. The Alpha bookmark is removed. The Beta `.nomedia` test file was removed by reverting the checkbox."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1048, "cache_read_input_tokens": 345219, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1048}, "output_tokens": 7, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "84392d1e-6625-43e5-8491-7adb913cbd1f", "uuid": "97b12c78-9879-4240-adc5-67a255db19c4", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T22:47:23.086Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1jw24DS4hgSSXrKoyA6"}
